            "review_text": "KHSim9\nKuala Lumpur, Malaysia56 contributions\n0\nGood food but.......\nDec 2019 • Couples\nWe ordered a beef pho and mixed spring roll of prawn and pork.The beansprouts have been blanched,thus not crunchy. Only basil herb provided compared to others who offered few types.The food is good but what irked us was my wife saw the staff poured used tea cups with tea into the tray that hold the free cold teapot.The tray has holes for the tea to go to the bottom tray.She then put back the teacups onto the tray without washing them!\nRead more\nWritten December 1, 2019",
