            "review_title": "Review at Hong Pho Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Season C\nHong Kong, China518 contributions\n1\nFavorite Pho of the Trip\nMar 2019 • Friends\nPeople told me Danang has no good food so we didn't have much expectations. When we hopped onto Grab, we asked the driver to recommend a local favorite pho place to us and he took us to Pho Hong. It was our first pho in Danag so we were very happy with what we got. Each of us ordered a pho for ourselves and a spring roll platter to share. We finished our pho but not the platter because it was too big and too oily for us. LOVE THE BROTH but some people might find it too light and not even flavors.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 18, 2019",
